OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start dry
OL,6,Fwith areas of cloud breaking up during
OL,7,Fthe morning, with plenty of hot
OL,8,Fsunshine developing. However, through
OL,9,Fthe afternoon a further increase in
OL,10,Fcloud could generate a few locally
OL,11,Fheavy showers. Feeling humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will be rather
OL,14,Fcloudy with further showers breaking
OL,15,Fout at times, though these should
OL,16,Flargely die out overnight allowing a
OL,17,Ffew clear spells to develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
