OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday will start dry and
OL,6,Fbright, but cloud will build through
OL,7,Fthe morning with some showers breaking
OL,8,Fout into the afternoon. A few heavy
OL,9,Fshowers are possible. Still very warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,12,Fand rather breezy on Wednesday with
OL,13,Ffurther showers possible. A drier and
OL,14,Fless breezy end to the week with some
OL,15,Fsunshine, though feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
